 "name_en": "Sales Integration for SAP S/4HANA Utilities (7JO)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Integration for SAP S/4HANA Utilities (7JO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Utilities companies offer their energy and water contracts (e.g. for electricity) as products to B2C customers via various sales channels. They can use the sales order as an initial document for the order to cash process in SAP S/4HANA Utilities.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__ul_qny_r4b_ybc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Sales Order to Sell a New Energy Contract.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Sales Order to Change the Product of an Existing Energy Contract.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Sales Order to Terminate an Existing Energy Contract.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display Sales Order for an Energy Contract.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__ul_krp_v4b_ybc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Streamline energy order integration using the SAP S/4HANA sales order and the <a class=\"xref\" href=\"https://help.sap.com/docs/SAP_S4HANA_ON-PREMISE/19d48293097f4a2589433856b034dfa5/2b2fd9fb158e4629bf9106c80dcbf7ff.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\">SAP S/4HANA Sales Order (A2A) API</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__loio00b43187d1874e1b935a8949697f9e37_ul_nnj_nt1_qbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Selling configurable utilities products that offer the B2C customers attractive options for electricity contracts and translate them via the Utilities Product Integration Layer (UPIL) into billing master data of <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA</span> Utilities.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Avoid creation of unnecessary master data in deregulated markets before a market communication approval is assured.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>SAP S/4HANA Utilities 的销售集成 (7JO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">公用事业公司通过各种销售渠道将其能源和水合同（例如电力）作为产品提供给 B2C 客户。他们可以将销售订单用作 SAP S/4HANA Utilities 中订单到收款流程的初始凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__ul_qny_r4b_ybc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单以销售新能源合同。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单以更改现有能源合同的产品。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单以终止现有能源合同。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示能源合同的销售订单。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\">\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__ul_krp_v4b_ybc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 SAP S/4HANA 销售订单和 SAP <a class=\"xref\" href=\"https://help.sap.com/docs/SAP_S4HANA_ON-PREMISE/19d48293097f4a2589433856b034dfa5/2b2fd9fb158e4629bf9106c80dcbf7ff.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\">S/4HANA 销售订单 (A2A) API</a> 简化能源订单集成</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1c169ae9af194c95981c78c5123b3169__loio00b43187d1874e1b935a8949697f9e37_ul_nnj_nt1_qbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">销售可配置的公用事业产品，为 B2C 客户提供有吸引力的电力合同选项，并通过公用事业产品集成层 (UPIL) 将其转换为 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA</span> Utilities 的开票主数据。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在保证市场通信批准之前，避免在解除管制的市场中创建不必要的主数据。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
